<wpt lat="45.361470" lon="-121.659530"><ele>1825.8</ele><name>Upper Newton Creek canyon below the Gates (map 42 star, 6000')</name><desc>source: node of OSM Newton Creek at DEM 5,990 ft, about 0.1 mi below Newton Creek Falls; map 42's star by the 6000' label; sno-park 4,330' + 1,800' climb = 6,130'; confidence: low; pdf_page: 200; book_elev_ft: 6000; quote: The ultimate goal is to reach the upper Newton Creek canyon, a distance of only 4 miles one way and a climb of 1,800 feet.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Gates of the Mountain</name><desc>1. Clark Creek Sno-Park -&gt; Old Elk Meadows Trail, east end: straight (low), 0.26 mi | 2. Old Elk Meadows Trail, east end -&gt; Joins the summer Elk Meadows Trail (Clark Creek bridge): osm (medium), 0.65 mi | 3. Joins the summer Elk Meadows Trail (Clark Creek bridge) -&gt; Newton Creek crossing: osm (high), 0.52 mi | 4. Newton Creek crossing -&gt; Forest on the south-west bank 1: straight (low), 0.14 mi | 5. Forest on the south-west bank 1 -&gt; Forest on the south-west bank 2: straight (low), 0.19 mi | 6. Forest on the south-west bank 2 -&gt; Forest on the south-west bank 3: straight (low), 0.12 mi | 7. Forest on the south-west bank 3 -&gt; Down into the creek bed, where it becomes skiable: straight (medium), 0.20 mi | 8. Down into the creek bed, where it becomes skiable -&gt; Newton Creek bed 1: straight (medium), 0.18 mi | 9. Newton Creek bed 1 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 2: straight (medium), 0.14 mi | 10. Newton Creek bed 2 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 3: straight (medium), 0.22 mi | 11. Newton Creek bed 3 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 4: straight (medium), 0.20 mi | 12. Newton Creek bed 4 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 5: straight (medium), 0.09 mi | 13. Newton Creek bed 5 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 6: straight (medium), 0.20 mi | 14. Newton Creek bed 6 -&gt; Below Lamberson Butte: straight (medium), 0.19 mi | 15. Below Lamberson Butte -&gt; Newton Creek bed 8: straight (medium), 0.13 mi | 16. Newton Creek bed 8 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 9: straight (medium), 0.19 mi | 17. Newton Creek bed 9 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 10: straight (medium), 0.13 mi | 18. Newton Creek bed 10 -&gt; Newton Creek bed 11: straight (medium), 0.14 mi | 19. Newton Creek bed 11 -&gt; Upper Newton Creek canyon below the Gates (map 42 star, 6000'): straight (medium), 0.08 mi</desc>
